    "body": {
      "value": "Included: field preparation of any trophy for shipment, lodging, accommodations, food and beverages. Not included: Oklahoma license and tag fees, transportation to the lodge, gratuity. A wounded animal is charged the same as a kill and we will do our best to recover it. Whitetail season runs October through December and dates are subject to availability. Exotics are available year round. Deposits lock in price.",
